## Usage

### Step 1: Precompute 2D Features (Recommended)
```bash
python scripts/precompute_2d_features.py \
    --data-config-path /path/to/config.yaml \
    --output-dir /path/to/precomputed_2d
```

### Step 2: Train with Precomputed Features
```bash
python train_open_vocab_v2.py \
    --precomputed-dir /path/to/precomputed_2d \
    --num-epochs 50 \
    --batch-size 4
```

### Step 3 (Alternative): Train with Online Extraction
```bash
python train_open_vocab_v2.py \
    --label-path lang_seg/label_files/ade20k_objectInfo150.txt \
    --lseg-ckpt-path lang_seg/checkpoints/demo_e200.ckpt \
    --odise-model-config-path Panoptic/odise_caption_coco_50e.py
```
